<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT- S. Barney ups KLA.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT- S. Barney ups KLA.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney analyst Tia-Min Pang raised his rating on KLA Instruments Corp to buy from hold and set a 12-month target price on the stock of $50, his office said.</p>
<p>-- The analyst introduced an earnings estimate of $1.94 per share for the fiscal year ending June 1998 and $2.26 for calendar year 1998 of $2.26 per share.</p>
<p>-- E. Auchard, Wall Street bureau, 212-859-1736</p>
</text>
